<title>USA: Energen files shelf for $250 mln debt/equity.</title>
<headline>Energen files shelf for $250 mln debt/equity.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Energen Corp on Friday filed a shelf registration with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission for up to $250 million in debt securities and common stock.</p>
<p>Energen said it would use net proceeds for general corporate purposes, including working cpaital, funding of investments in or extensions of credits to subsidiaries, possible acquisitions and reduction of debt.</p>
</text>
